@baseUrl = http://localhost:5224
@token =
@machineId = DEV-MKN-001
@failureId = DEV-FLR-001
@riskAnalysisId =
@maintenancePlanId = DEV-PLN-001
@executionId = DEV-EXE-001

### Health - live
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Health - ready
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/dashboard?months=6&riskyMachineCount=5

### Machines - filtered and paged
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/machines?page=1&pageSize=20&riskLevel=Critical&sortBy=riskScore&descending=true

### Machine detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/machines/{{machineId}}

### Working data
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/machines/{{machineId}}/telemetry
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-07-30",
  "recordCount": 1440,
  "anomalyScore": 72.5,
  "productionIntensityPercent": 88
}

### Algorithmic + ML hybrid analysis (Development mock)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/risk-analyses/machines/{{machineId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: http-demo-risk-001

{
  "mockScenario": "success"
}

### ML failure / FailClosed
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/risk-analyses/machines/{{machineId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mockScenario": "timeout"
}

### Risk boundary preview
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/risks/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "machineLearningScore": 80,
  "algorithmicInput": {
    "failureCount30Days": 1,
    "daysSinceLastMaintenance": 45,
    "totalDowntimeHours30Days": 2,
    "repeatedFailure": false,
    "criticality": "Orta",
    "counterLimitOverrunPercent": 0,
    "productionStoppingFailureCount30Days": 0
  }
}

### Failures
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/failures?page=1&pageSize=20

### Start/add intervention
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/failures/{{failureId}}/interventions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "DEV-INT-001",
  "startedAt": "2026-07-30T18:00:00Z",
  "personnelId": "DEV-PER-1",
  "note": "Titreşim ve rulman kontrolü başlatıldı."
}

### Close failure (intervention must be started)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/failures/{{failureId}}/close
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resolution": "Rulman değiştirildi.",
  "rootCause": "Rulman aşınması",
  "downtimeMinutes": 480
}

### Maintenance plans
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/maintenance/plans?page=1&pageSize=20

### Start maintenance execution
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/maintenance-executions/plans/{{maintenancePlanId}}/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "executionId": "{{executionId}}",
  "personnelId": "DEV-PER-1"
}

### Complete maintenance execution
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/maintenance-executions/{{executionId}}/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "result": "Bakım tamamlandı.",
  "durationMinutes": 90,
  "cost": 1250,
  "replacedParts": [
    { "partCode": "BRG-6204", "partName": "Rulman", "quantity": 2 }
  ]
}

### Early warnings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/alerts?page=1&pageSize=20

### Decision history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/decision-history?page=1&pageSize=20

### Reports
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/reports/failure-analysis

### ERP mock pull (Development; production requires X-Integration-Key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/integrations/erp/pull-machines
X-Integration-Key: {{token}}

### ERP work order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/integrations/erp/work-orders/{{maintenancePlanId}}
X-Integration-Key: {{token}}

### ERP integration logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/integrations/erp/integration-logs
X-Integration-Key: {{token}}
### Yerel tanım modülleri
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/local-definitions/modules
Accept: application/json

### Firmalar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/local-definitions/companies
Accept: application/json

### Yerel makine için uçtan uca hibrit risk
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/risk-analyses/local-machines/MAK-0001?reason=Manuel%20yonetici%20dogrulamasi
Accept: application/json

### Sayaç / çalışma verisi (sayaç farkı backend tarafından hesaplanır)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/local-workflows/meter-readings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "machineId": "MAK-0001",
  "counterDefinitionId": 1,
  "date": "2026-08-05",
  "shiftId": 1,
  "startValue": 100,
  "endValue": 108.5,
  "workingMinutes": 480
}
